        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-05-18T19:29:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We don't know the full story but there isn't anything in the sixth paragraph that leads me to believe they don't know who La Capitan is by that point. &nbsp;However, La Capitan may not recognize them because it's hard to say if this happened before or after that first encounter for her since she has all those time traveling shenanigans.&nbsp;</p>",
