        "raw": "<p>We don&#39;t know the full story but there isn&#39;t anything in the sixth paragraph that leads me to believe they don&#39;t know who La Capitan is by that point. &nbsp;However, La Capitan may not recognize them because it&#39;s hard to say if this happened before or after that first encounter for her since she has all those time traveling shenanigans.&nbsp;</p>",
