        "id": 141776,
        "name": "Heckbringer",
        "username": "Heckbringer",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/58956e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-05-18T19:35:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The fact that the portal is \"bizarre\" and that she's described in terms of physical traits rather than familiarity is what implies to me that&nbsp;<em>they</em> or&nbsp;<em>we&nbsp;</em>(the readers of the backstory) are meeting her for the first time.</p><p>As for her introducing herself, I quite like the idea that \"time traveling shenanigans\" mean that this is the first time&nbsp;<em>she</em> is meeting&nbsp;<em>them.</em></p><p>Thanks!</p><p>...and if anyone has a line on actual canon, that would be of great interest to me!</p>",
